<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>KAGAMI 鏡 — Japanese Restaurant</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kagami — a modern Japanese restaurant. Sushi, sashimi, ramen and seasonal omakase, crafted daily.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Noto+Serif+JP:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

